@BBV.HR.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7072

### 1. OpenID Connect Discovery Document
GET {{BBV.HR.Api_HostAddress}}/.well-known/openid-configuration
Accept: application/json

### 2. Token Exchange - Password Flow (Admin login)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{BBV.HR.Api_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=admin@bbv.vn&password=Password123!&scope=openid profile email roles api

### 3. Token Exchange - Password Flow (Manager login)
# @name managerLogin
POST {{BBV.HR.Api_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=manager@bbv.vn&password=Password123!&scope=openid profile email roles api

### 4. Token Exchange - Password Flow (Employee login)
# @name employeeLogin
POST {{BBV.HR.Api_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=employee@bbv.vn&password=Password123!&scope=openid profile email roles api

### 5. Token Exchange - Client Credentials Flow (M2M)
# @name serviceLogin
POST {{BBV.HR.Api_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=bbv-hr-service&client_secret=bbv-service-secret-key-12345&scope=api

### 6. UserInfo Endpoint (using Admin Access Token)
@accessToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.access_token}}
GET {{BBV.HR.Api_HostAddress}}/connect/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Get Projects (Protected API)
GET {{BBV.HR.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
